      <p data-dc-tpl="610" style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--muted); margin: 0px 0px 20px;">Read-only results, with the full finding list. Rate-limited and cacheable.</p>
      <div data-dc-tpl="611" style="background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.85; overflow: auto;">
        <div data-dc-tpl="612"><span data-dc-tpl="613" style="color: var(--action);">GET</span> /v1/scan?domain=example.com</div>
        <div data-dc-tpl="614" style="height: 10px;"></div>
        <div data-dc-tpl="615" style="color: var(--muted);">{</div>
