      <p data-dc-tpl="630" style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--muted); margin: 0px 0px 20px;">Rules are declarative and reviewed in the open. Every rule needs a human-readable reason.</p>
      <div data-dc-tpl="631" style="background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.85; overflow: auto;">
        <div data-dc-tpl="632" style="color: var(--muted);"># rules/page/credential_form.yml</div>
        <div data-dc-tpl="633"><span data-dc-tpl="634" style="color: var(--violet);">id</span>: form.credentials_insecure</div>
        <div data-dc-tpl="635"><span data-dc-tpl="636" style="color: var(--violet);">when</span>:</div>
