    <div data-dc-tpl="664">
      <h3 data-dc-tpl="665" style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px 0px 8px;">What HIP does not claim</h3>
      <p data-dc-tpl="666" style="font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--muted); margin: 0px; max-width: 720px; text-wrap: pretty;">HIP does not prevent every threat, and a high score is not a guarantee of safety — it means the checks HIP ran, on the date it ran them, found no significant problems. Scores are evidence to reason with, not a verdict to outsource judgement to.</p>
